@startuml
title AdScale — RTB hot path и фиксация событий
autonumber

actor DSP
participant "API Gateway" as gateway
participant "Bidding Service" as bidding
collections "Immutable L1\nsnapshot" as l1
database "Redis L2\nwarm/recovery" as redis
database "Bidding read-model\nPostgreSQL" as readmodel
database "Bidding PostgreSQL\nauction decision + outbox" as biddingdb
participant "Outbox relay" as relay
queue "Kafka" as kafka
participant "Statistics" as stats
participant "Analytics" as analytics
participant "Finance" as finance
database "Finance PostgreSQL\nmoney SoT" as financedb
actor "Browser / App" as user
participant "Event Collector" as collector

DSP -> gateway : OpenRTB bid request
gateway -> bidding : validated request\n(deadline propagated)
bidding -> l1 : read immutable snapshot\n+ allowance

alt L1 valid version / age
  l1 --> bidding : campaigns, targeting,\nallowance, creatives
  alt eligible and valid Finance-issued allowance
    bidding -> bidding : choose winner\nwithin latency budget
    bidding --> gateway : bid response
    gateway --> DSP : OpenRTB response\n(P95 <= 80 ms; cutoff 60 ms)
  else no safe data / no allowance
    bidding --> gateway : no-bid
    gateway --> DSP : no-bid
  end
else stale / missing L1
  bidding --> gateway : no-bid
  gateway --> DSP : no-bid
end

par outside response dependency
  bidding -> biddingdb : append decision + outbox\nlocal ACID transaction
  biddingdb -> relay : unpublished outbox
  relay -> kafka : auction.bid-result.v1\nacks=all
  kafka -> stats : at-least-once
  kafka -> analytics : at-least-once
end

== Background warm / recovery (не sync dependency bid response) ==

redis -> l1 : projector / loader\nversioned snapshot
readmodel -> redis : rebuild / warm shared L2
readmodel -> l1 : cold start / recovery

== Billing по факту impression/click ==

user -> gateway : signed impression/click
gateway -> collector : verified route + token
collector -> kafka : ad.impression.v1 /\nad.click.v1
kafka -> stats : at-least-once
kafka -> analytics : at-least-once
kafka -> finance : billable event / charge request
finance -> financedb : idempotent ACID ledger transaction
financedb --> finance : committed balance + outbox
finance -> kafka : finance.ledger-entry.v1

note over l1,redis
Hot path читает только immutable L1.
Redis L2 и PostgreSQL — background warming,
propagation и recovery.
end note

note over finance,financedb
Billing стартует по impression/click,
не по auction.bid-result.
Redis allowance ограничивает уже зарезервированную квоту;
окончательный баланс — только в Finance PostgreSQL.
end note

@enduml
